# NOTICE — third-party components and provenance

Every component below was traced to a primary source before it was listed:
the upstream file or page, the pack zip, or the generator that emits the
bytes. A licence file or README sitting beside an asset is a **claim**, not
evidence, so no row here rests on one alone. The method, the evidence per
verdict, and the limits are in [`docs/92_provenance_audit.md`](docs/92_provenance_audit.md).

Nothing is listed that the audit did not verify. Where a verification could
not be completed from this machine, the row says so.

